# 📄 **NoTowPolicy.md (Expanded + Ultra‑Detailed)**

```markdown
# NO‑TOW POLICY — EH Graced Roads Solutions LLC

## Core Statement

> **WE DO NOT PROVIDE TOW SERVICE OR WINCHING SERVICE.**

This is a mandatory, non‑negotiable policy.

---

## Purpose

- Maintain repair‑only identity  
- Reduce downtime  
- Avoid unnecessary transfers  
- Protect driver safety  
- Maintain brand consistency  
- Ensure AI agents follow correct workflows  

---

## Enforcement Areas

### 1. Backend
- No tow endpoints  
- No tow vendor integrations  
- No tow yard routing logic  

### 2. Frontend
- No tow buttons  
- No tow UI elements  
- No tow suggestions  

### 3. AI Agents
- No tow workflows  
- No tow language  
- No tow recommendations  

### 4. Documentation
- No tow references except policy enforcement  

---

## Examples of Violations (Prohibited)
- “Dispatch a tow truck”  
- “Route to nearest tow yard”  
- “Winch the vehicle out”  
- “Tow vendor list”  

---

## Examples of Allowed Language
- “Dispatch a repair technician”  
- “Coordinate mobile repair”  
- “Select repair vendor”  
- “Guide driver to safe location”  

---

## Summary

This policy defines the identity of EH Graced Roads Solutions LLC.  
It must be enforced across:
- Code  
- UI  
- AI  
- Documentation  
- Workflows  
- Marketing  
- Operations  

No exceptions.
```

